  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-487-510">北方に何ごとぞ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-510-551">雲　雲を引具して空を急いだ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-551-556">街</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-556-576">街は雨の喪服</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-576-593">街はとほい</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-593-607">街は沈む</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-607-657">アンテナは潜望鏡をまねて雲を観た</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-657-686">北方に何ごとぞや？</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-686-712">欅は丘で街を観た</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-712-718">欅は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-718-742"><rb>終日</rb><rt>いちにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-742-777">　雲を迎へて雲を送つた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-777-822">欅は終日　濡れる街を眺めてゐた</seg></p>
    </body>
